cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QuadCond / AENNA-3D: condition-aware G-quadruplex and i-motif prediction with an AlphaGenome join"
abstract: >-
  QuadCond predicts G-quadruplex and i-motif propensity from sequence and
  solution conditions with calibrated, per-head claim limits and explicit
  refusal outside the applicability domain. AENNA-3D is its browser workbench.
  Both are served by one process, and variant scans can be joined exactly to
  AlphaGenome regulatory scores.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/himanshushekhar367-sudo/Quadcond"
keywords:
  - g-quadruplex
  - i-motif
  - nucleic acid structure
  - genomics
  - alphagenome
